ImageMagick 7 with JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF, HEIC and AVIF only and the policy of
graphics/ImageMagick7/files/policy.xml of azsupport/ports: bin/magick and the
names linked to it (convert, identify, ...), in the place of those of the port.
Its libraries, headers, configuration and policy are the package
libimagemagick7, which imagick7 of PHP links too. It conflicts with
ImageMagick6 and ImageMagick67. Versions and options:
share/doc/ImageMagick7/VERSIONS of libimagemagick7.
